  "decision_conditions": [
    "The Local Planning Authority having due regard to its own evidence and assessing the submitted evidence, considers, that on the balance of probability, the evidence provided does not satisfactorily demonstrate that the outbuilding at the rear of property known as 475 Montagu Road, London, N9 0HS has been in continuous use as a self contained residential dwelling for a period of at least four years from the date of submission of the application. The evidence is insufficient and inconsistent to demonstrate that the material change of use commenced before 25.04.2024 and continued for a continuous period of at least four years from the date of the submission of the application; nor does it otherwise establish immunity under the ten-year period. Accordingly, the use has not been shown to be lawful.\r"
